# Production Architecture & Refactoring Rules

Guidelines for writing testable, production-ready code with clean boundaries and hermetic unit tests.

## Core Principles
- Adhere to SOLID principles and clean modular architecture.
- Separate domain logic from side-effects, I/O, and external APIs.
- Enforce type safety, strict interface contracts, and immutability where applicable.
- Write hermetic unit tests verifying edge cases, boundary values, and explicit error handling.

